OL,3,COllie Watkins: What Al Hilal interest
OL,4,Cmeans for the striker's future
OL,6,FThe inference from Unai Emery is clear
OL,7,F- the decision not to include Ollie
OL,8,FWatkins in Aston Villa's 4-0 defeat at
OL,9,FBrighton was made by the striker and
OL,10,Fnot the Head Coach.
OL,12,FThis comes amid multiple bids from
OL,13,FSaudi Arabian club Al Hilal. Villa's
OL,14,Fleading goalscorer of the Premier
OL,15,FLeague era is seemingly willing to
OL,16,Fdestroy his reputation with Villa fans
OL,17,Fto get that big money move.
OL,19,FAs a Villa player, the least expected
OL,20,Fis that you give your all to wear the
OL,21,Fshirt.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
