OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787617145
OL,3,COllie Watkins: What Al Hilal interest
OL,4,Cmeans for the striker's future
OL,6,FBut when we say big money, we mean
OL,7,Fastronomical.
OL,9,FWatkins reportedly earns #130k per
OL,10,Fweek at Villa but Al Hilal's current
OL,11,Fstriker Karim Benzema is on a weekly
OL,12,F#2m. The Villa man is 30 and this is a
OL,13,Fonce in a lifetime opportunity to earn
OL,14,Fthat sort of cash.
OL,16,FPreviously Villa might've been able to
OL,17,Flean on the harm such a move would do
OL,18,Fto his England career but Ivan Toney's
OL,19,Finclusion in Thomas Tuchel's World Cup
OL,20,Fsquad shows that is less of a barrier
OL,21,Fnow.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
