OL,3,COllie Watkins: What Al Hilal interest
OL,4,Cmeans for the striker's future
OL,6,FIn the fullness of time we will
OL,7,Fhopefully learn more about Watkins'
OL,8,Fmotivation.
OL,10,FHe might feel slightly less loyal to
OL,11,FEmery than others after not being
OL,12,Fpicked in the starting team for the
OL,13,Fhuge Champions League quarter-final
OL,14,Fagainst PSG in 2025. He later said he
OL,15,Fwas "fuming" with the decision.
OL,17,FMuch has happened since though,
OL,18,Fincluding the Europa League trophy win
OL,19,Fin Istanbul in May - Watkins was a key
OL,20,Fpart of that.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787617145
OL,3,COllie Watkins: What Al Hilal interest
OL,4,Cmeans for the striker's future
OL,6,FBut a big summer rebuild has turned
OL,7,Fincreasingly complicated. It is very
OL,8,Fpossible Villa will be left with just
OL,9,Ffive of the 11 players who started the
OL,10,Ffinal.
OL,12,FEzri Konsa, Youri Tielemans, Lucas
OL,13,FDigne and Morgan Rogers have all left.
OL,14,FIn Zion Suzuki Villa already have a
OL,15,Freplacement for goalkeeper Emi
OL,16,FMartinez who almost joined Juventus
OL,17,Fand could well leave before the end of
OL,18,Fthe transfer window.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1787617145
OL,3,COllie Watkins: What Al Hilal interest
OL,4,Cmeans for the striker's future
OL,6,FThere was some excitement with the new
OL,7,Fplayers Villa have bought but that has
OL,8,Fbeen replaced by anxiety for many
OL,9,Fsupporters after being humbled on the
OL,10,Fopening day.
OL,12,FVilla will need an 'us against the
OL,13,Fworld' mentality to get through this
OL,14,Fperiod. Unless things change
OL,15,Fdramatically, Watkins is not part of
OL,16,Fthat.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/5
